+## Development commands
+
+Install [mise](https://mise.jdx.dev/) and the tools declared in `mise.toml`, then
+install the Rust components and wasm target declared in `rust-toolchain.toml`:
 
 ```sh
-mise exec -- cargo build --workspace --locked
-mise exec -- cargo test --workspace --locked
-mise exec -- cargo fmt --all -- --check
-mise exec -- cargo check-all
-mise exec -- cargo doc-all
+mise install
