+
+`quick --workspace <absolute-path>` accepts multiple Cargo workspaces, including
+workspaces in sibling Git repositories. It scans each distinct Git repository once
+and merges absolute changed paths before selecting source owners, mapped consumers
+and reverse dependencies across all explicit workspaces. Staged, unstaged, deleted,
+renamed and untracked inputs participate; global or unmapped inputs retain the
+conservative workspace selection. Always packages still execute on unchanged runs.
