+Git repository. With multiple repositories, it applies only to the invocation's
+current-directory Git repository, which must own an explicit workspace; every other
+repository compares against its own `HEAD`. An invalid caller base or a caller
+outside those repositories fails. `--select-only` prints the existing selection JSON;
+its `base` field remains the requested base and `reasons` reports every repository's
